    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_10",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Dno.Ovo međe izjaviti samo debil Ali narode bez mozga pa vi ste mu to omogućili da pljačka. Bravo ovce za šišanje.Svako radi šta hoće ali samo dok mu se dozvoli",
      "author": "Dusanka Popovic",
      "created_at": "23 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_11",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Glupak ovako mi vracamo a ne vi Vi pilau djep",
      "author": "Ruza Radojevic",
      "created_at": "22 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_12",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "E JESI ĆACI",
      "author": "Djerdjika Papulin",
      "created_at": "22 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_13",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Kad guzica progovori ,pamet zanemi...",
      "author": "Mirko Sheik",
      "created_at": "22 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_14",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "PLAGIJATOR - DEMAGOG - LOPOV .",
      "author": "Мирчета Станковић",
      "created_at": "21 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_15",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Plagijator",
      "author": "Dott Žare",
      "created_at": "21 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_16",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Sljedeći put će da se zaduže.",
      "author": "Mirko Danilovic",
      "created_at": "21 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_17",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Morali bi da pozajme od seljaka",
      "author": "Milanko Stanisic",
      "created_at": "19 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_18",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "OVO MOZE DA KAZE SAMO DEBIL.",
      "author": "Nevenka Sretenovic",
      "created_at": "17 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_19",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Ko razume, shvatiće.",
      "author": "Radiša Radosavljević",
      "created_at": "17 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_20",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Tupson do tupsona",
      "author": "Zoran Misita",
      "created_at": "17 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_21",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "To je vrh njihove pameti",
      "author": "Tomislav Stojancul",
      "created_at": "16 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_22",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Plagijator",
      "author": "Riki Sabanovic",
      "created_at": "16 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_23",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Kakav doktor. Plagijator",
      "author": "Živoslav Grujić",
      "created_at": "16 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_24",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Bez kometara.Bedno",
      "author": "Milunka Djordjevic",
      "created_at": "15 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_25",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Sve sami doktori\n.Jedna tako htela da bude direktorica doma zdravlja sa osam razreda škole.Ne odbijaju takvi funkcije...Nisu joj dopistili, ali bi ona tu ulogu rado igrala...Ćacika.",
      "author": "Verica Radivojevic",
      "created_at": "15 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_26",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Samo vi uzimajte kredite,dobro se zaduzujte a mi jadan narod trpimo . Vratiće narod ta vaša veselja jer se Bože moj vi dobro provodite.",
      "author": "Ruzica Ruska Petrovic",
      "created_at": "15 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_27",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Ti si bre pokrao obj zemlju...lud je narod SAMO Motka, tO JE LEK ZA SVE",
      "author": "Tanja Ljubenović",
      "created_at": "15 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_28",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Udri stoko serem ti se u glavvu\nPotrci skupljaj stoku da jede i pije krv ikosti mucenila koji ziote dadode braneci Srbiju.Prokleto vam sve nesrece koju conite protiv srpske suze o krvi i vjere.",
      "author": "Nikola Milošević",
      "created_at": "14 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_29",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Jel to doktorat-plagijat beše..",
      "author": "Boban Dencic",
      "created_at": "14 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_30",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Zadužio si nas i bogu dušu. Nepismene budaletine vas i dalje podržavaju dok nas pljačka te a vi se bogatite",
      "author": "Djordjevic Branka",
      "created_at": "14 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_31",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Jel ispituju kod preuzimanja diploma???Kupio bi 3,4 komada!!!",
      "author": "Zoran Kiza Milenkovic",
      "created_at": "14 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_32",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Koja pametna...",
      "author": "Kaja Burazer",
      "created_at": "14 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_34",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Не треба журити,очекује се вртоглави пад цене,одрицање од дипломе и бројних понуда за сведоке сараднике.",
      "author": "Milan Cirkovic",
      "created_at": "14 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_35",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/807531923306561/posts/2111394896253584",
      "post_id": "2111394896253584",
      "text": "Nisam do sada znala da se ,krediti dobiaju bezpovratno.Super da se nebi zaduživali narode dižite kredite.",
      "author": "Radana Rada Mikic",
      "created_at": "13 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2111394896253584_36",
